@startuml sequence_review_delta
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Goal Metrics - Review delta-vs-today render

actor User
participant "Scrubber" as Sc
participant "TileContext" as Ctx
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API

User -> Sc: Pick 2026-04-15
Sc -> Ctx: selectedReviewDate
Ctx -> T: signal change
T -> C: load('review', '<date>')
par parallel reads
  C -> API: GET /goal-progress/at?asOf=<date>
  API --> C: { count: 8, target: 30 }
also
  C -> API: GET /goal-progress/current
  API --> C: { count: 12, target: 30 }
end
C --> T: current=historical, today=now\ndeltaLabel = '-4 vs today', deltaTone='success'
T --> User: REVIEW pill, ring at 27%, '-4 vs today' (green: today is better)

@enduml
